# REQUEST FLOW

For every Groww API:

```text
Flutter
    │
    │ Request
    ▼
Node.js Backend
    │
    │ Add/forward required Groww headers
    ▼
https://api.groww.in
    │
    ▼
Groww
    │
    │ Response
    ▼
Node.js Backend
    │
    ▼
Flutter
```

The backend should return Groww's HTTP status code and response body as closely as possible.

