# IMPORTANT STATIC IP REQUIREMENT

The backend will eventually run on a server with a public static IPv4.

The purpose is:

```text
Flutter
   ↓
Backend Domain
   ↓
Backend Server Static IP
   ↓
Groww
```

Groww should see the backend server's public IP.

The custom domain used by Flutter is only the backend URL.

Example:

```text
Flutter:
https://api.my-domain.com/v1/order/create
```

Backend:

```text
https://api.groww.in/v1/order/create
```

Do not confuse the domain with the server's static public IP.

